{
 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 🤖🧠 第3周-Day1：预训练：数据、规模与涌现能力\n",
    "\n",
    "📊 **今日概览**：今天我们深入大模型最核心的环节——预训练！理解为什么模型需要海量数据，以及"涌现能力"这个神奇现象背后的原理。\n",
    "\n",
    "💡 **学习目标**：掌握预训练的核心概念，理解规模效应与涌现能力的关系"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "import seaborn as sns\n",
    "from IPython.display import display, Markdown\n",
    "\n",
    "# 设置中文显示\n",
    "plt.rcParams['font.sans-serif'] = ['SimHei', 'DejaVu Sans']\n",
    "plt.rcParams['axes.unicode_minus'] = False\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"🚀 第3周-Day1：预训练数据分析启动！\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 📊 数据规模 vs 模型性能\n",
    "\n",
    "让我们直观看看不同规模模型的数据需求对比："
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 大模型数据规模对比\n",
    "models = [\n",
    "    {'name': 'GPT-2', 'params': '1.5B', 'data': '15B', 'year': 2019},\n",
    "    {'name': 'GPT-3', 'params': '175B', 'data': '300B', 'year': 2020},\n",
    "    {'name': 'PaLM', 'params': '540B', 'data': '715B', 'year': 2022},\n",
    "    {'name': 'GPT-4', 'params': '1.8T', 'data': '3T', 'year': 2023},\n",
    "    {'name': 'Claude 3', 'params': '1T', 'data': '1.5T', 'year': 2024}\n",
    "]\n",
    "\n",
    "# 提取数据\n",
    "model_names = [m['name'] for m in models]\n",
    "param_counts = [m['params'] for m in models]\n",
    "data_counts = [m['data'] for m in models]\n",
    "years = [m['year'] for m in models]\n",
    "\n",
    "# 创建图表\n",
    "fig, (ax1, ax2) = plt.subplots(1, 2, figsize=(15, 6))\n",
    "\n",
    "# 参数规模变化\n",
    "ax1.bar(model_names, [float(p.replace('B', '').replace('T', '000')) for p in param_counts], color='skyblue')\n",
    "ax1.set_title('模型参数规模（单位：B）', fontsize=12, fontweight='bold')\n",
    "ax1.set_ylabel('参数数量（B）')\n",
    "ax1.tick_params(axis='x', rotation=45)\n",
    "\n",
    "# 数据规模变化\n",
    "ax2.bar(model_names, [float(d.replace('B', '').replace('T', '000')) for d in data_counts], color='lightcoral')\n",
    "ax2.set_title('训练数据规模（单位：B）', fontsize=12, fontweight='bold')\n",
    "ax2.set_ylabel('数据量（B tokens）')\n",
    "ax2.tick_params(axis='x', rotation=45)\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.show()\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"📈 观察趋势：参数规模和数据规模都在指数级增长！\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 🌊 涌现能力可视化\n",
    "\n",
    "什么是涌现能力？让我们用简单的数学模拟展示："
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 模拟涌现能力 - 小步改进突然产生质变\n",
    "np.random.seed(42)\n",
    "\n",
    "# 不同规模模型的性能曲线\n",
    "scales = np.linspace(10, 1000, 100)  # 模型规模\n",
    "performance_small = np.sqrt(scales) * 0.5  # 小模型：缓慢线性增长\n",
    "performance_medium = scales**0.7 * 0.3  # 中等模型：加速增长\n",
    "performance_large = scales**0.9 * 0.2  # 大模型：指数级增长（涌现）\n",
    "\n",
    "# 添加一些突变点来模拟涌现现象\n",
    "emergence_points = [300, 600, 900]\n",
    "for point in emergence_points:\n",
    "    idx = np.argmin(np.abs(scales - point))\n",
    "    performance_large[idx:] *= 1.5  # 突然跃升\n",
    "\n",
    "# 绘图\n",
    "plt.figure(figsize=(12, 6))\n",
    "plt.plot(scales, performance_small, label='小模型 (基础能力)', linewidth=2, alpha=0.7)\n",
    "plt.plot(scales, performance_medium, label='中等模型 (组合能力)', linewidth=2, alpha=0.7)\n",
    "plt.plot(scales, performance_large, label='大模型 (涌现能力)', linewidth=3, color='red')\n",
    "\n",
    "# 标记涌现点\n",
    "for point in emergence_points:\n",
    "    plt.axvline(x=point, color='orange', linestyle='--', alpha=0.7)\n",
    "    plt.text(point, max(performance_large)*0.8, '🌊\\n涌现点', \n",
    "             ha='center', va='center', fontsize=10, \n",
    "             bbox=dict(boxstyle='round', facecolor='orange', alpha=0.7))\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.xlabel('模型规模 (参数数量)')\n",
    "plt.ylabel('性能指标')\n",
    "plt.title('模型规模与性能的关系 - 涌现现象演示', fontweight='bold')\n",
    "plt.legend()\n",
    "plt.grid(True, alpha=0.3)\n",
    "plt.show()\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"🌊 关键发现：当模型规模达到临界点时，突然获得新的能力！\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 🎯 涌现能力分类与示例\n",
    "\n",
    "让我们看看不同类型涌现能力的特点："
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 涌现能力分类数据\n",
    "emergence_types = [\n",
    "    {'type': '上下文学习', 'threshold': 10, 'description': '无需示例直接理解任务', 'example': '翻译：Hello → 你好'},\n",
    "    {'type': '指令跟随', 'threshold': 20, 'description': '理解复杂指令意图', 'example': '用列表形式总结文章要点'},\n",
    "    {'type': '思维链', 'threshold': 50, 'description': '逐步推理得出答案', 'example': '17×25=？→ 先算10×25=250，再算7×25=175，合计425'},\n",
    "    {'type': '代码生成', 'threshold': 100, 'description': '理解并编写复杂代码', 'example': '实现一个快速排序算法'},\n",
    "    {'type': '多步推理', 'threshold': 200, 'description': '复杂逻辑链推理', 'example': '如果A>B, B>C, 那么A？C？'}\n",
    "]\n",
    "\n",
    "# 创建能力热力图\n",
    "fig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(10, 6))\n",
    "\n",
    "# 准备数据\n",
    "types = [e['type'] for e in emergence_types]\n",
    "thresholds = [e['threshold'] for e in emergence_types]\n",
    "colors = plt.cm.Reds([t/max(thresholds) for t in thresholds])\n",
    "\n",
    "# 绘制能力阈值条形图\n",
    "bars = ax.bar(types, thresholds, color=colors, alpha=0.8)\n",
    "ax.set_ylabel('涌现阈值 (参数规模 B)', fontweight='bold')\n",
    "ax.set_title('不同涌现能力的规模需求', fontweight='bold')\n",
    "plt.xticks(rotation=45, ha='right')\n",
    "\n",
    "# 添加数值标签\n",
    "for bar, threshold in zip(bars, thresholds):\n",
    "    height = bar.get_height()\n",
    "    ax.text(bar.get_x() + bar.get_width()/2., height,\n",
    "            f'{threshold}B', ha='center', va='bottom', fontweight='bold')\n",
    "\n",
    "# 添加示例文本\n",
    "for i, (type_name, example) in enumerate([(e['type'], e['example']) for e in emergence_types]):\n",
    "    ax.text(i, thresholds[i] + 10, f'📝\\n{example}', \n",
    "            ha='center', va='bottom', fontsize=8,\n",
    "            bbox=dict(boxstyle='round,pad=0.3', facecolor='lightblue', alpha=0.7))\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.show()\n",
    "\n",
    "# 打印详细信息\n",
    "print(\"🎯 不同涌现能力详解：\\n\")\n",
    "for emergence in emergence_types:\n",
    "    print(f\"• **{emergence['type']}** (需≥{emergence['threshold']}B参数)\")\n",
    "    print(f\"  描述：{emergence['description']}\")\n",
    "    print(f\"  示例：{emergence['example']}\")\n",
    "    print()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 💻 实战：模拟数据质量对预训练的影响\n",
    "\n",
    "让我们用代码模拟不同数据质量对模型性能的影响："
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 模拟不同数据质量下的模型表现\n",
    "np.random.seed(123)\n",
    "\n",
    "# 数据质量参数 (0-1之间，1为最高质量)\n",
    "qualities = np.linspace(0.1, 1.0, 20)\n",
    "\n",
    "# 模型规模参数\n",
    "model_sizes = [10, 50, 100, 500]  # 单位：B参数\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.figure(figsize=(12, 8))\n",
    "\n",
    "for size in model_sizes:\n",
    "    # 根据模型规模计算对数据质量的敏感度\n",
    "    sensitivity = min(size / 100, 2.0)  # 大模型对数据质量更敏感\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # 基础性能 + 数据质量增益 + 随机噪声\n",
    "    base_performance = np.log(size) * 0.5\n",
    "    quality_boost = qualities ** sensitivity * 0.8\n",
    "    noise = np.random.normal(0, 0.05, len(qualities))\n",
    "    \n",
    "    total_performance = base_performance + quality_boost + noise\n",
    "    \n",
    "    plt.plot(qualities, total_performance, \n",
    "             label=f'{size}B 模型', linewidth=2, marker='o', markersize=4)\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.xlabel('数据质量', fontsize=12, fontweight='bold')\n",
    "plt.ylabel('模型性能指标', fontsize=12, fontweight='bold')\n",
    "plt.title('数据质量对不同规模模型性能的影响', fontweight='bold')\n",
    "plt.legend()\n",
    "plt.grid(True, alpha=0.3)\n",
    "plt.show()\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"📊 关键结论：\\n\")\n",
    "print(\"• 大模型需要更高质量的数据才能发挥性能\")\n",
    "print(\"• 数据质量边际效应递减：从0.5提升到1.0比从0.1提升到0.5效果更好\")\n",
    "print(\"• 大模型对数据质量更敏感，但达到高质量后收益更大\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 🧠 业务关联思考\n",
    "\n",
    "💡 **糖水店经营启示**：\n",
    "\n",
    "预训练就像我们准备开店前的准备工作：\n",
    "🏪 **基础准备** → 店铺装修、设备购置（小规模准备）\n",
    "📚 **原料积累** → 收集配方、采购食材（数据积累）\n",
    "👨‍🍳 **技艺提升** → 反复练习、改进口味（规模效应）\n",
    "⭐ **口碑爆发** → 突然成为网红店（涌现能力）\n",
    "\n",
    "关键点：**足够的规模积累才能带来质的飞跃！**\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "🎯 **今天知识点总结**：\n",
    "✅ 预训练需要海量数据（万亿级别tokens）\n",
    "✅ 规模增大到临界点会产生涌现能力\n",
    "✅ 不同能力需要不同规模阈值才能出现\n",
    "✅ 数据质量对大模型至关重要"
   ]
  }
